'''The Corkscrew''' was a section of the [[Boonta Eve Classic]] [[Podracing|podrace]] course that consisted of several small, weaving turns. Located on the course after the hazardous [[Jett's Chute]], the Corkscrew ended where the narrow [[Devil's Doorknob]] passageway opened onto the [[Hutt Flats]].<ref name="CL 2016" />

